{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/traversal\/depthfirstsearchevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What a depth-first search reports, in order, with the classification of CLRS §22.3."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SQ","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SH","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal"]]},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Traversal\/SearchEvents.swift#L25","fileName":"SearchEvents.swift"},"title":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Traversal"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:9Traversal21DepthFirstSearchEventO","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/backEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/crossEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/discover(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/forwardEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearchEvent\/treeEdge(_:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Travers